WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:04.356 --> 00:14.066 align:middle
Transcript of Chair Powell's
Press Conference September 17,

00:14.526 --> 00:17.506 align:middle
2025 CHAIR POWELL.

00:17.506 --> 00:18.466 align:middle
Good afternoon.

00:18.466 --> 00:20.006 align:middle
My colleagues and I
remain squarely focused

00:20.006 --> 00:22.936 align:middle
on achieving our dual-mandate
goals of maximum employment

00:22.936 --> 00:26.326 align:middle
and stable prices for the
benefit of the American people.

00:26.326 --> 00:29.646 align:middle
While the unemployment rate
remains low, it has edged up,

00:29.646 --> 00:31.646 align:middle
job gains have slowed,
and downside risks

00:32.666 --> 00:33.686 align:middle
to employment have risen.

00:33.686 --> 00:35.146 align:middle
At the same time,
inflation has risen recently

00:35.146 --> 00:36.576 align:middle
and remains somewhat elevated.

00:38.526 --> 00:40.696 align:middle
In support of our goals,
and in light of the shift

07:05.396 --> 07:06.686 align:middle
and price-stability goals.

07:07.216 --> 07:07.656 align:middle
Thank you.

07:07.656 --> 07:09.326 align:middle
I look forward to
our discussion.

07:09.666 --> 07:13.476 align:middle
CHRIS RUGABER.

07:13.586 --> 07:14.616 align:middle
Great. Thank you.

07:14.826 --> 07:16.856 align:middle
Chris Rugaber at
Associated Press.

07:16.856 --> 07:21.776 align:middle
As you know, Fed Governor
Stephen Miran has continued-kept

07:21.776 --> 07:23.456 align:middle
his position at the
White House even

07:23.456 --> 07:24.646 align:middle
as he's joined the Fed Board.

07:24.646 --> 07:26.606 align:middle
This is the first
time, I believe,

07:26.606 --> 07:27.846 align:middle
the Fed's Board has had someone

07:27.846 --> 07:30.746 align:middle
with executive-branch
ties in decades.

07:31.346 --> 07:33.616 align:middle
Does this compromise
the Fed's independence

07:33.616 --> 07:34.806 align:middle
from day-to-day politics?

07:34.936 --> 07:38.256 align:middle
And, relatedly, how can you
maintain the public's perception

07:38.256 --> 07:40.466 align:middle
the Fed is politically
independent with this dynamic?

07:40.466 --> 07:40.766 align:middle
Thank you.
